    {
      "title": "Dilution",
      "excerpt": "Dilution If you invest in the ADSs and Warrants in this\noffering, your ownership interest will be immediately diluted to the extent of the difference between the initial public offering price\nper ADS and the as adjusted net tangible book value per ordinary share or ADS immediately after this offering. The following amounts have been translated\ninto U.S. dollars from Australian dollars based upon the Australian dollar/U.S. dollar exchange rate of 0.6693 as of December 31, 2025. As of December 31, 2025, our historical net\ntangible book value was A$26,009,937 (or US$17,408,451), or A$2.71 (or US$1.81) per ADS. Historical net tangible book value per ADS represents\nour total tangible assets less total liabilities, divided by the number of ordinary shares outstanding as of December 31, 2025, converted\nto ADSs at an ADS-to-ordinary share ratio of 1-to-10. Without taking into account any other c",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
